atte, you pop the balloon with the right answer to a sum (addition, subtraction, and multiplication tables), and the balloons speed up or slow down to suit the player. In Bokstäver, a voice says a Swedish letter and the child finds it. No time limit."}],["$","p","Each child has a profile with their own kitten colour, stars, and progress. Right answers bring confetti and a dancing kitten, streaks bring rainbows, and a round ends in a fireworks party.",{"children":"Each child has a profile with their own kitten colour, stars, and progress. Right answers bring confetti and a dancing kitten, streaks bring rainbows, and a round ends in a fireworks party."}]],"$L12","$L13"]}],"$L14"]}]]}]]}]}],"$L15"]}]
12:["$","p",null,{"className":"game-details","children":"Runs in the browser with nothing to install: phone, tablet, or computer, and in VR or passthrough on a Meta Quest 3. Built with three.js and WebXR. No accounts and no server; progress stays in the browser of the device. The game itself is in Swedish."}]
